lass=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.821.247.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2013972.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237491\">1032B47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237490\">1032B14</a></p>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237718\">1092E20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237715\">1092E10</a></p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237498\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237642\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237647\">1092G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237651\">1016A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238399\">5510C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237652\">1016A40</a></p><p>Tighten the engine oil drain plug to the\nrecommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Plug</p></td><td><p>ENGINE OIL DRAIN PLUG</p></td><td><p>M18</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.7 - 2.1</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p>Refill the engine lubrication circuit using\nthe recommended oil.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA 20K</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>If the vehicle is subject to particulary\nsporty usage, use the recommended oil for the engine lubrication\ncircuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA RACING</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>For the optimum operation of the engine\nin particularly harsh climatic conditions (temperatures below -20\ndegrees C), use the recommended oil for the engine lubrication circuit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Oli [l]</p></td><td><p>ENGINE LUBRICATION CIRCUIT</p></td><td><p>SELENIA PERFORMER</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF postition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with th